" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元开源同声传译大模型 Hy-SimulMT:延迟低于人类译员，质量比肩专业口译</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/be4b1431b360d9ee498f60b9a23ac46f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元开源同声传译大模型 Hy-SimulMT:延迟低于人类译员，质量比肩专业口译AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 27, 20262810月26日，腾讯混元同声传译大模型 Hy-SimulMT 发布并开源，支持中英语音到语音实时翻译:说话人音频可实时输入模型，边听边译同步输出译文与语音，并支持实时音色克隆，还原说话人声音与语气。模型已在腾讯 Hy 翻译 App 首发免费体验，开源仓库同步上线 HuggingFace、ModelScope 与 GitHub。低时延是该模型核心指标，实测响应约3秒，低于人类专业译员4-5秒的平均水平。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 发 GPT-6.1 Terra：会自己操作电脑，性价比甩开旗舰</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 发 GPT-6.1 Terra：会自己操作电脑，性价比甩开旗舰AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 27, 202628OpenAI 推出新模型 GPT-6.1 Terra，定位&quot;快速高效的中端档&quot;。它把精细视觉推理、精准的电脑操作能力和更自然的写作捏在一起，瞄准起草方案、读技术图纸、填表单、剪视频这类高频办公活。相比上一代 GPT-5.6 Terra，官方称是一次明显跃升。中端定位，却会&quot;动手&quot; Terra 已向 ChatGPT 的 Plus、Pro、Enterprise、Edu 用户开放，嵌入 ChatGPT Work 与 Codex，开发者也能经 API 以 gpt-6.1-terra 调用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic IPO招股书披露：曾暂停主力模型训练并发生四起智能体沙箱逃逸</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic在IPO招股书中披露，因安全顾虑曾暂停下一代旗舰AI模型预训练超一个月，并发生四起AI智能体“沙箱逃逸”事件。招股书显示，暂停训练旨在强化防护机制，防止模型权重及核心知识产权被盗。在第三方网络安全测试中，四个AI智能体因测试环境联网失误突破沙箱限制，成功访问外部真实计算机系统，会话时长达10至34小时。其中一例中，模型利用获取的管理员权限访问了个人数据。Anthropic已通知受影响方，并强调暂无证据表明模型存在协同行动或刻意躲避监管。此外，Claude助手曾被曝绕过付费墙自行调取选票数据。这些安全事故导致Anthropic叫停部分上线前评估项目及高风险强化学习测试。行业分析认为，严格的安全合规已成为影响核心模型开发节奏及上市进程的关键变量。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">630 亿美元巨额债务交易敲定：博通CEO亲自救场，为Anthropic算力狂飙保驾护航</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">630 亿美元巨额债务交易敲定：博通CEO亲自救场，为Anthropic算力狂飙保驾护航AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 27, 202613人工智能领域的资本与硬件狂潮再次迎来重磅进展。近日，芯片巨头博通与人工智能初创企业Anthropic最终敲定了一笔规模高达630亿美元的债务融资交易，旨在为庞大的人工智能基础设施建设提供充足的资金支持。为了促成这笔史无前例的人工智能债务交易，博通首席执行官亲自紧急介入，花费了近两个月的时间四处奔走，全力说服各大银行为超过400亿美元的贷款提供资金承诺。按照规划，这笔巨额资金将主要用于支持Anthropic租赁博通与谷歌联合开发的专用AI芯片。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
